    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "12 THE WATERFRONT IS A SUPERB FOUR BEDROOM RIVERSIDE PROPERTY, SITUATED IN THE HEART OF THE PICTURESQUE VILLAGE OF TARMONBARRY.\r\n\r\nWe at Davis Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this exceptionally well presented four-bedroom property, perched on the banks of The River Shannon. \r\n\r\nThe Waterfront is a really well maintained development, with landscaped green and recreational areas, which lead to the River bank. The development provides a unique setting, as it is in the centre of village, but well concealed on a quiet Shannon facing site. \r\n\r\nThe c.1,600 sq.ft. accommodation comprises, of four spacious bedrooms, master ensuite, a sitting-room, kitchen/dining room, utility, WC, and a large family bathroom. Located just ten minutes from Longford Town, this development consists of only 16 exclusive four bedroom homes, along the grassy banks of Irelands biggest inland waterway. \r\n\r\nThe beautiful village of Tarmonbarry itself, is located between the towns of Longford and Strokestown along The N5. This thriving Village has become well known throughout Ireland as a centre for Angling, Boating and water sports. The excellent marina facilities around the village make it a popular stop-off point for cruisers. The award-winning restaurants and bars, give a unique atmosphere and are popular with residents and tourists alike. Longford Town is just a 5-minute drive away along the N5.\r\n\r\nThe neighbouring village of Clondra just across the River Shannon (1.5km), is a small waterside village nestled just off the main N5 road from Longford to Castlebar and situated on the banks of the rivers Shannon and Camlin. At the heart of Clondra is Richmond Harbour, the terminus of the Royal canal. The village is a crossing point of the Royal Canal and the Camlin River.\r\n\r\nThe canal itself fell into disrepair in the late 20th century but has been recently restored for recreation and navigation purposes. The Royal Canal Greenway provides a 130km walking and cycling trail from Maynooth to Clondra village. An ideal location for nature lovers, anglers and walkers, \r\nThe Waterfront is within a short walking distance of bars, restaurants shops, church, childcare facilities and the local primary school, while Center Parcs- Longford Forest Holiday Resort, is just a 20 minute drive.\r\n\r\nPlease call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford, or phone us on 043-33 50555 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nEircode: N39 F688"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall- 2.20m x 5.70m\r\n\r\nLounge Area- 5.50m x 5.00m\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room- 5.60m x 5.00m\r\n\r\nUtility- 2.20m x 1.40m\r\n\r\nWC- 2.20m x 1.50m\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom- 5.35m x 4.00m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2- 3.90m x 3.30m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3- 3.30m x 3.30m\r\n\r\nBedroom 4- 3.40m x 3.20m\r\n\r\nBathroom- 2.35m x 2.15m\r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\nReceipt of these particulars implies an obligation to conduct all negotiations through Padraic Davis Auctioneers. The contents do not constitute an offer or form the basis of any contract. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition etc, are given in good faith and are believed to be correct. Any intending purchasers should not rely on them and are strongly advised to view the property for themselves. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided are for guidance purposes only. These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer; they do not form any part of a resulting contract."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Village centre - Riverside location\r\n\r\nTarmon Harbour & Marina a short stroll\r\n\r\nLow maintenance rear garden\r\n\r\nGarden Shed\r\n\r\nBedroom Balcony overlooking The Shannon\r\n\r\nSouth-west Facing Rear Garden\r\n\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\n\r\nWheelie Bin Storeroom\r\n\r\nAccess to the garden from the rear\r\n\r\nExcellent energy rating- B\r\n\r\nStone façade \r\n\r\nFitted Wardrobes to the Bedrooms\r\n\r\nPatio doors from kitchen leading to the rear garden\r\n\r\n7km to Longford Town\r\n\r\n20 minute drive to Roscommon Town\r\n\r\nJust a short walk to the Harbour & Marina\r\n\r\nJust a 25-minute drive to Center Parcs Holiday Resort\r\n\r\nIdeally suited to an Owner Occupier or Holiday Home\r\n\r\nOn the N5 and just 8km to the N4\r\n\r\nWithin a few minutes drive to the N63 & Athlone Road\r\n\r\n1.5km from the Royal Canal Way\r\n\r\nClose to the villages of Newtownforbes, Killashee and Rooskey\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll to the local Restaurants & Bars\r\n\r\nSolid wood timber floors in the Living Room & Bedrooms\r\n\r\nRecess Lighting \r\n\r\nUtility room \r\n\r\nMains water and Sewerage"
